		"ALG_pinLiftCharacter.oddPotentialGivesMinusSelfVerified":true,
		"ALG_pinLiftCharacter.interactionCaveat":"U(Psibar Psi) -> U(chi Psibar Psi). For chi = -1 and U(S) = (lambda/2) S^2 the interaction term does not flip: L_{m,lambda} -> -L_{m,-lambda}; the interacting field equation gamma.D Psi = (m + U'(S)) Psi is mapped to the one with U'(S) -> -U'(-S) (lambda -> -lambda). Exact covariance of the interacting theory under chi = -1 elements requires U odd (U(-S) = -U(S)).",
