		"QNT_kreinSignature.method":"basis V of the eigenspace (exact Gaussian rationals); M = (V^dagger V)^-1 V^dagger B V is the matrix of B restricted (B V = V M verified); M^2 = I so the eigenvalues are +-1 and the signature of the B-form on the space is ((d + Tr M)/2, (d - Tr M)/2) with respect to the positive Hilbert product.",
